    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can soldier on in spite of damage dealt to you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Endurance\" title=\"Endurance\">Endurance</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, when you would normally take damage from an attack, you can instead choose to take half damage and move -1 step along the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p>",
